    "created_at": "2020-09-21T20:05:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-21T20:05:11Z",
    "body": "While very common on different websites, I couldn't find a proposal for standardizing a date range input here.\r\n\r\nSome analysis around different UI controls is currently happening at the [Open UI](https://open-ui.org) project, which also lists [some examples for date range inputs](https://open-ui.org/components/datepicker.research#%E2%96%BC-range).\r\n\r\nThere are many different use cases for date and time ranges, like booking websites, scheduling apps, etc., which could benefit from a standard solution for ranges.\r\n\r\nImportant to note here is that not only date ranges should be covered but also time ranges and maybe even combinations of both.\r\n\r\nSebastian",
