    "updated_at": "2020-10-05T22:45:33Z",
    "body": "I was [actioned](https://www.w3.org/International/track/actions/960) by W3C I18N in our telecon of 2020-10-01 with noting our interest in this topic.\r\n\r\nThe requirements for date and time range inputs would be very interesting, including guidance on how the `lang` attribute (locale) and time zone interact with the user experience.",
